+
+## Case work (`backend/app/api/casework.py`, migration 0010)
+
+All routes need a session; the case is addressed by its alert number and must be visible to the caller.
+
+| Route | Purpose |
+|---|---|
+| `GET /api/events/{number}/related` | Linked cases |
+| `POST /api/events/{number}/links`, `DELETE /api/events/{number}/links/{link_id}` | Link or unlink two cases, with a reason |
+| `GET /api/events/{number}/followups`, `POST .../followups`, `PATCH .../followups/{followup_id}` | Follow-up tasks; every change is appended to a history that cannot be edited |
+| `GET /api/events/{number}/followup-assignees`, `GET /api/archive/assignees` | People a task or an archive filter can name |
+| `GET /api/events/{number}/legal-hold`, `POST .../legal-hold`, `POST .../legal-hold/release` | Manual legal hold; while active, the case's evidence cannot be purged |
+| `POST /api/exports/verify` | Upload a downloaded export package and check it against its manifest |
+| `GET /api/audit/evidence` | Auditor view: stored evidence with its integrity state |
